It is lunchtime.
Prakash and I step out of the office.
There is AC in the office.
So it is very cold there.
We come outside.
Suddenly, a hot wind blows.
Prakash looks at the sky.
"Maya, it is terribly hot today," he says.
I agree with that.
"Yes, it is very hot," I say.
"Will it rain today?" Prakash asks me.
"The weather app says, it will rain in the evening," I reply.
Prakash laughs.
"Look at this sun!" he says.
"It will not rain today."
I also think so.
We walk quickly to the canteen.
In this heat, I want to drink cold water.
